# Design Handoff (Claude Design ↔ this project)

When the user provides a Claude Design `.zip`, a `.design/handoff/<slug>/`
directory, or a `claude.ai/design/...` URL, follow
`.cursor/skills/import-claude-design/SKILL.md`.

When the user asks to "open Claude Design", "generate a design via browser",
or invokes `/claude-design`, follow
`.cursor/skills/claude-design-browser/SKILL.md`.

Do not improvise. Always reconcile `design-tokens.json` against
`{{tokens_file}}` before generating components, and always reuse existing
components in `{{components_dir}}/` over generating new ones.

The supported flow is:

```
/claude-design  →  browser MCP drives claude.ai/design  →  Export .zip
       │                                                      │
       └──────────  scripts/ingest-claude-design.mjs  ────────┘
                                  │
                  /import-claude-design (or auto handoff)
                                  │
              implement against this project's frontend
```

For the reverse direction (project → Claude Design), do not build a custom
uploader. Use Claude Design's "Web capture" against the running dev server,
or the Figma MCP if a designer is in the loop.
